, {"file_name": "03.png", "id": "2131092734129191", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622166_2131092737462524_8680641054341149174_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ysQsb4TalkEQ7kNvwH4sN-R&_nc_oc=AdpBRFNss_-retQHWNCItYvkhGjSRF9bLWPe-Y1b9EEqQEth0-xzrc594dHJZsCCNdQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTOjCMWidLcIE8pGMR4fNd0mvUizMQ4SBwTwGWrX5QcOw&oe=6B083EB7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UTfL1ZErAvYQ7kNvwHCaydK&_nc_oc=AdrS_ADAnxlTXxpZqM6R_up6cF4TTdKfy5vxVyLfHs2NZH0lpi9IzdUuGtAycoAqLng&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTixelJmRwtNsrwuHeAkEzWZLd_sY1SfUiagGQiOaWmbA&oe=6B08404A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iVrkt8xkj28Q7kNvwF45pWc&_nc_oc=AdqML0VLi9jsfB07uTXVslyJ0_fXIqKy0yPVDkXIaK8WmYx0Pyh1p28974LGBzree3o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRQqX9J7E0VA2m5QbcoUbLK5L4pt_D5DCZYpj38IlSylg&oe=6B0865AF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OVCQ_1c-IzsQ7kNvwHFCfqw&_nc_oc=Adry1-_kQY9tw2YKcJTRoC7KPOyl_lQURljxCZTRAyl0zC0y4PnP-Zh_aJCPWO8EXBc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTgZdriZ0PsGe94Cx915PAnzVUMqFu5Tp7x5RTf3JAnAA&oe=6B084F03"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lqJvAp2DYUoQ7kNvwFUdyH-&_nc_oc=AdoDDePXaBX522bfQ57KjJooD_CnNBBnMchW4CtameVd_JBxS1o_NsnZV68pypd73CA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRbf3Biyq_6evqHSI1od4dsvBEeZ5VGpXJDezSXWLUhug&oe=6B084758"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m2untaC9HZMQ7kNvwGLR5gI&_nc_oc=Adpy94_F1hJEaoQMgmGSZ4HccvAvTQ1vRI